      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "You can restore deleted WhatsApp messages by reinstalling the application and recovering from a cloud backup as outlined in the WhatsApp Help Center.",
        "snippet_links": [
          {
            "text": "WhatsApp Help Center",
            "link": "https://faq.whatsapp.com/618575946635920"
          }
        ],
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "reinstalling the application and recovering from a cloud backup"
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Restoring from Cloud Backup"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you have a previous backup stored on Google Drive (Android) or iCloud (iPhone) that was made before you deleted or lost the messages, you can bring them back.",
        "reference_indexes": [
          1
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Check your last backup date in WhatsApp under Settings > Chats > Chat Backup."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Uninstall WhatsApp from your phone."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Reinstall WhatsApp from the Google Play Store or Apple App Store."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Open the app and verify your exact phone number."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Tap Restore when prompted to recover your chat history."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          2,
          3
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Watch a step-by-step visual guide on how to retrieve your deleted WhatsApp messages using cloud backups:"
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Checking Notification History (Android)"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If a message was deleted (\"Delete for everyone\") after you received it, you can sometimes read it through your phone's notification log.",
        "reference_indexes": [
          4
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Open your phone Settings."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Search for and enable Notification history."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Check the log to view past notifications from WhatsApp."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          5
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you can let me know whether you use an Android or an iPhone, and if you have an active backup, I can give you more specific steps."
      }
    ],
